flowchart TB
  Client[Client authentifié] -->|JWT| Supabase[Supabase Auth + autorisation]
  Supabase -->|Edge Function + X-API-Key| HTTP[Express Media API]
  HTTP --> Guards[Helmet · clé technique · rate limit · limites multipart]
  Guards --> Router[Routeur versionné /api/v1]

  subgraph Monolith[Monolithe modulaire]
    Router --> Health[Module Health]
    Router --> MediaRoute[POST /media]
    MediaRoute --> Controller[Media Controller]
    Controller --> Service[Media Service]
    Service --> Processor[file-type + Sharp]
    Service --> Repository[Repository SQL]
    Service --> Storage[Port de stockage]
  end

  Repository --> PG[(PostgreSQL)]
  Storage --> Volume[(Volume média privé)]
  Guards --> Redis[(Redis rate limit)]

  Public[GET /media/nom-unique.ext] --> Controller
  Controller -->|JPEG/PNG public immuable| Public

  Service --- Policy[JPEG/PNG · magic bytes · réencodage · aucune route DELETE]
